# Stow ignore list for the `hypr` package.
#
# monitors.conf is rewritten by hypr-monitor on every hotplug, so the live file
# is machine state and the repo copy is only a first-boot template. The stow
# phase in scripts/sync.sh seeds it when absent and never touches it after.
# Keep this in step with STOW_SKIP in scripts/lib.sh.
#
# Patterns are Perl regex; one without a slash matches a basename (see `man stow`).
monitors\.conf
